( vi) For issuing a writ of mandamus directing the Fourth Respondent (The Bombay Society for Prevention of Cruelty to Animals) to ensure that all horses and ash 5 pil-36.11(OS) ponies are shoed in compliance with Rule 3 of the Prevention of Cruelty to Draught and Pack Animals Rules, 1965 (for short "the said Rules of 1965"); and (vii) For issuing a writ of mandamus for ensuring compliance of Rules 6(i) and 6(iii)
