The first Respondent is the Municipal Corporation of Greater Mumbai constituted under the Mumbai Municipal Corporation Act, 1888.
The Fourth Respondent has been charged with the duties and powers to aid of the Government, the Animal Welfare Board and the Local Authorities in enforcing the provisions of the Prevention of Cruelty to Animals Act, 1960 ( for short "the said PCA Act").

